<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE reference PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Reference//EN" "reference.dtd">
<reference id="reference_qd5_gdq_cqb">
    <title><?oxy_comment_start author="zhangqin1@cmiot.cmcc" timestamp="20241101T141832+0800" comment="该内容模块为基础版本共用，请勿随意删减。若需添加仅适用于某型号的内容，请添加批注说明"?>+HTTPERR<?oxy_comment_end?></title>
    <shortdesc>上报HTTP错误代码。</shortdesc>
    <refbody>
        <table id="table_btl_krz_3qb">
            <tgroup cols="2">
                <colspec colname="c1" colnum="1" colwidth="3*" align="left"/>
                <colspec colname="c2" colnum="2" colwidth="7*" align="left"/>
                <thead>
                    <row>
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2"><cmdname>+HTTPERR</cmdname></entry>
                    </row>
                </thead>
                <tbody>
                    <row outputclass="has_bgc">
                        <entry>语法</entry>
                        <entry>响应</entry>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <entry>
                            <codeblock><cmdname>+HTTPERR</cmdname></codeblock>
                        </entry>
                        <entry>
                            <msgblock id="msgblock_emt_xb5_pqb">+HTTPERR:&lt;id>,&lt;code></msgblock>
                        </entry>
                    </row>
                    <row outputclass="has_bgc">
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2">命令描述</entry>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2">上报HTTP错误代码。</entry>
                    </row>
                    <row outputclass="has_bgc">
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2">参数描述</entry>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2"
                                ><varname>&lt;id></varname>整型，通过<msgph>+HTTPCREATE</msgph>返回的实例索引，范围：0~4。<fn>M5310-E/MN328-B范围：0~1。</fn></entry>
                    </row>
                    <row>
                        <entry namest="c1" nameend="c2"
                            ><varname>&lt;code></varname>整型，错误类型，包括HTTP错误响应码或者HTTP连接错误码，如果是解析到HTTP响应码异常，将额外输出服务器信息，如404
                            NOT FOUND，参考响应码章节5与错误码章节6。</entry>
                    </row>
                </tbody>
            </tgroup>
        </table>
    </refbody>
</reference>
